## Notes about Demo Environment

Since this test suite runs on a public demo site:

- Product catalog may change

- Search results may differ by browser and timing

- Some actions may behave inconsistently depending on session/cookies

- Cart state may persist between actions

Therefore, tests were designed to validate stable signals instead of strict assumptions.


## Automation Best Practices as per Playwright's recommendations: 

- Prefer stable selectors (getByRole, locator with meaningful attributes) 

- Assert visibility before interacting with elements 

- Use cross-browser validation 

- Avoid brittle absolute selectors whenever possible Validate real UI signals 

- Use polling (expect.poll) when UI updates asynchronously

